        <head>Pimples, Eczema &amp; Running Sores. Sensational Zam-Buk Cure.</head>
        <p>Pimples, Eczema &amp; Running Sores. Sensational Zam-Buk Cure.</p>
        <p>How terrible are the ravages of eczema and how great are the disease killing powers of Zatal link are strikingly illustrated in the experience of Mrs. Elizabeth Kendall, of 2, Parwich Cottages; Depot-street,Derby. To a "Derbyshire Advertiser' representative Mrs. Kendall said : " For two years I suffered from eczema in tit( hands and arms. I was quite helpless, and corti: do nothing in the house, not even cook a btl of food. The eczema first appeared round m: wrists, and gradually spread along my arms a, far as the elbows and to my hands and fingterE Small pimples appeared on my arms and handt which irritated terribly, and then dischar: water and matter. The skin was very red, 1: raw beef, and I had to have my arms and bat covered up in slings. At night the irritation Iva: dreadful. / lost a lot of sleep, and I had toll' 'with ml) a;•nts stretched out on pillows, as I cot, not bear the bedclothes to touch the affectoL parts. In the morning the pillows would be soa/- ing wet. The skin was very painful who touched.</p>
        <p>" I had medical treatment, and applied variotl4 remedies, but. without receiving any benei The doctor said that in his long experience had not seen a worse case of eczema. improvement resulted from the remedies, firm I was always doing something in the way treatment. I was suffering acutely when I next-door neighbour, who has great faith Zam-Buk, strongly recommended it. "I applied the Zam-Buk where the skin was. sore. After the first few dressings I felt reli, At the end of the first week I saw a change 014 if taking place. Before, the skin had scaled °0 about every other day, but I now noticed that the skin was remaining, and that the wounds wero commencing to heal. At first L thought it ,c) good to last, but as continued to rub in Zam-Buk I had the joy of seeing that the improvt-e ment was maintained. Soon I was able to 10'ft the bandages off, and the skin was then firm healthy. I kept on using Zam-Buk, and La ' fourth week I was quite cured. "It is now nearly six months since my reco‘• -0 and, thanks to Zam-Buk, there has been no retul. of the complaint." •</p>
        <p>varioff4 benefit, ence</p>
